<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>KOREA Travel PWA</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@300;400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif; background-color: #FCF9F2; color: #4A4A4A; }
        .hand-drawn-border { border: 2px solid #4A4A4A; border-radius: 255px 15px 225px 15px/15px 225px 15px 255px; }
        .card { background: white; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding: 1rem; box-shadow: 5px 5px 0px #D9D2C5; border: 1px solid #4A4A4A; }
        .tag-eat { background-color: #FFB7B2; color: #8B0000; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; }
        .tag-buy { background-color: #B2CEFE; color: #00008B; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; }
        .tag-tips { background-color: #B2F0B2; color: #006400; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; }
        .nav-btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; background: #03C75A; color: white; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 5px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="pb-20">

    <header class="p-6 border-b border-gray-300 bg-white sticky top-0 z-10">
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold italic">🇰🇷 韓國六天五夜自由行</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">5/22 - 5/27 仁川．首爾</p>
    </header>

    <nav class="flex justify-around p-4 text-sm font-bold">
        <button onclick="showTab('itinerary')" class="text-blue-600 border-b-2 border-blue-600">每日行程</button>
        <button onclick="showTab('info')">基本資訊</button>
        <button onclick="showTab('budget')">預算/記帳</button>
    </nav>

    <main id="app" class="p-4">
        
        <section id="itinerary">
            <div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between">
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">5/23 (六) <span class="text-sm font-normal">☁️ 18°C / 24°C</span></h2>
                <button class="text-xs border px-2 py-1">+ 新增行程</button>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="flex justify-between">
                    <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">09:00 - 11:30</span>
                    <span class="tag-tips">景點攻略</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-lg">景福宮 韓服體驗</h3>
                <p class="text-sm mt-1"><b>攻略：</b>穿著韓服可免費進入景福宮。建議預約「旋律」或「ari」韓服店。</p>
                <a href="https://map.naver.com/v5/search/景福宮" target="_blank" class="nav-btn">🧭 Naver Map 導航</a>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="flex justify-between">
                    <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">12:00</span>
                    <span class="tag-eat">必吃美食</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-lg">옛골감자탕 馬鈴薯排骨湯</h3>
                <p class="text-sm mt-1"><b>必點：</b>濃郁排骨湯、最後記得加點炒飯 (Bokkeumbap)。</p>
                <a href="https://map.naver.com/v5/search/옛골감자탕" target="_blank" class="nav-btn">🧭 導航</a>
            </div>

            <div class="card border-l-4 border-orange-400">
                <div class="flex justify-between">
                    <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">14:00 (5/26)</span>
                    <span class="tag-tips">重要行程</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-lg">國技院 Kukkiwon</h3>
                <p class="text-sm mt-1">跆拳道聖地。<b>提示：</b>可參觀世界跆拳道總部，注意開放時間。</p>
                <a href="https://map.naver.com/v5/search/Kukkiwon" target="_blank" class="nav-btn">🧭 導航</a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="info" class="hidden">
            <div class="card">
                <h3 class="font-bold border-b mb-2 pb-1">✈️ 航班資訊</h3>
                <p class="text-sm">去程：5/22 13:45 (KHH) -> 17:40 (ICN)</p>
                <p class="text-sm">回程：5/27 13:05 (ICN) -> 15:10 (KHH)</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3 class="font-bold border-b mb-2 pb-1">🏠 住宿資訊</h3>
                <p class="text-sm">地點：弘大區 (Hongdae)</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card bg-red-50">
                <h3 class="font-bold border-b mb-2 pb-1 text-red-700">🚨 緊急聯絡</h3>
                <p class="text-sm">報警：112 / 急救：119</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-blue-600 underline">觀光諮詢：1330 (有中文服務)</p>
            </div>
        </section>

    </main>

    <div id="map-preview" class="p-4 mt-10">
        <h3 class="text-center italic font-bold mb-4">- 路線速寫 -</h3>
        <div class="hand-drawn-border h-48 bg-blue-50 flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute border-b-2 border-dashed border-gray-400 w-full top-1/2"></div> <div class="z-10 bg-white border border-black p-1 text-[10px] absolute top-10 left-10">弘大</div>
            <div class="z-10 bg-white border border-black p-1 text-[10px] absolute top-5 right-20">景福宮</div>
            <div class="z-10 bg-white border border-black p-1 text-[10px] absolute bottom-10 left-40">望遠</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 italic">手繪風地鐵與景點標示區</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        function showTab(tabId) {
            document.getElementById('itinerary').classList.add('hidden');
            document.getElementById('info').classList.add('hidden');
            document.getElementById(tabId).classList.remove('hidden');
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
